# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfplan
tfplan
# Provider lockfiles belong to root configurations, which commit theirs. This
# one only appears when `terraform validate` is run inside the module directly.
terraform/wif/.terraform.lock.hcl
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# uv resolves from pyproject.toml directly — CI runs `uv pip install -e .`,
# not `uv sync`, so the lockfile is a local artifact rather than a build input.
# The SDK is already pinned exactly in pyproject.toml.
uv.lock

